results.body:
incorrect expectation json format for:

  {
    "httpRequest" : {
      "path" : "/harvested"
    },
    "httpResponse" : {
      "statusCode" : 200,
      "reasonPhrase" : "OK",
      "body" : "delayed body",
      "delay" : {
        "timeUnit" : "SECONDS",
        "value" : 30
      },
      "timing" : {
        "injectedDelayMillis" : 30000,
        "totalTimeInMillis" : 30002
      }
    }
  }

 schema validation errors:

  1 error:
   - $.httpResponse.timing: is not defined in the schema and the schema does not allow additional properties

  OpenAPI Specification: https://app.swaggerhub.com/apis/jamesdbloom/mock-server-openapi/9.2.x
  Documentation: https://mock-server.com/mock_server/creating_expectations.html
